{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》片尾曲《大娛樂家》由三位女主角破格火辣濕髮造型拍MV，今日改由周嘉洛吳業坤及張振朗「肉 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》片尾曲《大娛樂家》由三位女主角破格火辣濕髮造型拍MV，今日改由周嘉洛吳業坤及張振朗「肉帛相見」神還原這個MV，惹火片段隨即於商場及社交平台全面流出，得到一眾藝人和觀眾激烈回應！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475203120670342_2419496196af9be1fa3fe7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 周嘉洛 原版MV三位女主角赤膊上陣，吳業坤就直接露胸，靠張家朗和周嘉洛膊頭遮住⋯⋯（圖片來源：77工作室）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475203120670342_2419496196af9be1fa3fe7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>原版MV三位女主角赤膊上陣，吳業坤就直接露胸，靠張家朗和周嘉洛膊頭遮住⋯⋯（圖片來源：77工作室）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475203274597896_18366219506af9be213f710.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 周嘉洛 周嘉洛表情抵死！（圖片來源：77工作室）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475203274597896_18366219506af9be213f710.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>周嘉洛表情抵死！（圖片來源：77工作室）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>周嘉洛張振朗紅唇惡搞《玫瑰戰爭》片尾MV 獲封「新福祿壽」</h2>\n<p>近日於社交平台及商場大屏幕突然瘋傳一段衝擊眼球二次創作影片，片段中周嘉洛聯同張振朗以及吳業坤齊齊赤裸上身驚喜亮相。三人為了完美還原《玫瑰戰爭》片尾曲《大娛樂家》MV中林夏薇姚子羚與傅嘉莉火辣造型，特意塗上鮮艷紅唇兼弄濕頭髮上陣。這個極具視覺衝擊力男神版惡搞MV瞬間辣爆全網，有網民期望3男組合適合擔任「新福祿壽」，並在今年台慶以同樣造型現身綜藝直播！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475203419538276_14449749146af9be22932cf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 周嘉洛 拍攝花絮曝光（圖片來源：77工作室）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475203419538276_14449749146af9be22932cf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>拍攝花絮曝光（圖片來源：77工作室）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>林夏薇楊茜堯對吳業坤惡搞給予高度評價</h2>\n<p>原版女主角看到這段瘋傳片段後隨即公開表態，林夏薇對於周嘉洛傾力演出給予極高評價並笑言：「簡直覺得佢似我，仲多過我似我自己，見到佢用心健身，原來係為咗扮我，佢成功咗。」姚子羚亦親自於社交平台留言大讚：「好正呀！張振朗你連條眉都學埋我呀」。同場其他藝人同樣被這段影片震撼，楊茜堯毫不留情直指畫面充滿油膩感，陳豪則認真點評指吳業坤扮傅嘉莉最為神似。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475203603089424_13700092616af9be248c452.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 周嘉洛 企C位嘅傅嘉莉變成吳業坤。（圖片來源：77工作室）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475203603089424_13700092616af9be248c452.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>企C位嘅傅嘉莉變成吳業坤。（圖片來源：77工作室）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>MV花絮曝光！三男對嘴模仿未獻聲留有遺憾</h2>\n<p>翻查這場惡搞風波源頭全因《玫瑰戰爭》這首由三位女主角親自獻唱片尾曲《大娛樂家》MV設定過於震撼。三位男藝人今次傾力拍攝只為向原版紅唇濕髮造型致敬，吳業坤更坦言今次拍攝完全是「肉帛相見」。不過這次轟動全城爆笑惡搞其實純屬對嘴型演出，三位男藝人全程並沒有真實獻聲重新錄製歌曲，引發蔣祖曼公開留言呼籲三位男士親口演唱「男聲版本」。<br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e7%8e%ab%e7%91%b0%e6%88%b0%e7%88%ad-%e5%a7%9a%e5%ad%90%e7%be%9a-%e5%82%85%e5%98%89%e8%8e%89-3540351/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">玫瑰戰爭｜姚子羚MV被指條眉好忙！傅嘉莉首獻聲 驚爆濕身look暗藏女星悲歌</a>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475203772315244_7368424486af9be269ca6a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 周嘉洛 MV花絮曝光。（圖片來源：77工作室）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475203772315244_7368424486af9be269ca6a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>MV花絮曝光。（圖片來源：77工作室）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475204022944486_13695662306af9be28e46a6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 周嘉洛 姚子羚在社交平台留言：「好正呀！張振朗你連條眉都學埋我呀！」（圖片來源：77工作室）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475204022944486_13695662306af9be28e46a6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>姚子羚在社交平台留言：「好正呀！張振朗你連條眉都學埋我呀！」（圖片來源：77工作室）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民直指姚子羚眉毛超級搶戲惹激烈討論</h2>\n<p>大批觀眾看完原版及惡搞版片段後立刻湧入各大討論區洗版，網民看完三位女主角極具衝擊性畫面紛紛錯重點，瘋狂留言笑指畫面質感似足洗頭水廣告。當中更有大量眼利觀眾發覺姚子羚化妝技巧極度搶眼，不斷留言直指她那對眉毛超級搶戲。針對這三位女星罕見破格造型網上甚至出現大量解密貼文，詳細探討這個衝擊性畫面背後是否暗藏著驚人劇情寓意。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475204263615204_16117690576af9be2af07fe.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 周嘉洛 （圖片來源：77工作室）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475204263615204_16117690576af9be2af07fe.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：77工作室）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475203120670342_2419496196af9be1fa3fe7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 周嘉洛 （圖片來源：77工作室）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475203120670342_2419496196af9be1fa3fe7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：77工作室）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17947520438201389_13648943756af9be2c2f358.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 周嘉洛 （圖片來源：77工作室）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17947520438201389_13648943756af9be2c2f358.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：77工作室）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475203274597896_18366219506af9be213f710.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 周嘉洛 （圖片來源：77工作室）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475203274597896_18366219506af9be213f710.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：77工作室）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/mv/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MV</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%90%b3%e6%a5%ad%e5%9d%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">吳業坤</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%91%a8%e5%98%89%e6%b4%9b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">周嘉洛</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b5%e6%8c%af%e6%9c%97/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張振朗</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：77工作室資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3543462\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 15 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T16:05:03.965933+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1511,"images":10,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T14:14:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T15:57:20.440527+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T15:57:20.440527+00:00","content_hash":"63049c6d3d8668bea4f3ad1a810fa4cb70cbb489f4db4139afea59f40e81a51f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}